  "notes": "Name fault buttons by their operation: CHECK / ПЕРЕВІРИТИ for component checks, RECOVER / ВІДНОВИТИ for existing IR recovery, SCAN / СКАНУВАТИ for I2C. Keep the component in its heading and preserve dispatch, admission, fonts, QR Help and the standard Back control.\n\nValidation: five focused host suites, 34 USB fault-recheck cases, independent reviews, checked build and verified USB install. Six CRC-verified device frames show fitted action labels and retained failed-check QR Help. Flashlight learning is preserved and BLE/Twin returns after QA.\n\nConnected-fixture investigation: both IR sensors initialize successfully after a fresh normal boot. NTC raw zero is reproduced by ordinary and isolated DMA acquisition; cooler preflight still measures near-zero incremental current. These two unresolved observations are documented, without declaring connected parts absent or suppressing their faults. Full physical/input/load acceptance remains separate.\n",
